--- !u!114 &1548392622556880718
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2833067429287871551}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eeb752860ae19c3489887ca65a2049ef, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  TutorialMenu:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Welcome to the Gaia Protocol, <color=#ffe45c>Commander</color>! As the
        Commander, you are tasked to restore these planets from their former glory
        and push back the <color=red>CORRUPTION</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Alright! Let's get into the basics. Here's your <color=#5cffe4>Main Menu</color>.
        Each planet has three <color=#5cffe4>LEVELS</color> that are currently infested
        with <color=#ad5cff>Corrupted Lifeforms</color> and <color=#ad5cff>KAIJUS</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: To cleanse each <color=#5cffe4>LEVEL</color>, you must complete all the
        <color=#ffe45c>Main Objectives</color> (and <i><color=#ffe45c>Side Objectives</color></i>)
        by commanding your own <color=#ffe45c>MECHA UNITS</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Each <color=#ffe45c>MECHA UNIT</color> will have their own strengths
        and weaknesses. <color=#ffe45c>WORKERS</color> are capable of handling objectives,
        while <color=#ffe45c>RANGERS</color> are your combatant units.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: 'Remember. Upgrade your units in the <color=#5cffe4>Armory</color>, then

        plan
        out your strategy in the <color=#5cffe4>Deployment Area</color> before deploying.'
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: That will be all for now, <color=#ffe45c>Commander</color>! For <color=#ffe45c>GAIA</color>!
  Forest1:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Your first mission is to <color=#5cffe4>Activate The Satellite Array</color>.
        You must establish connection from that planet back to <color=#ffe45c>GAIA
        HQ</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Unfortunately, we lost contact with our <color=#ffe45c>previous scout
        unit</color>, while you were in <color=#ffe45c>stasis</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: 'Intel suggests there is a <color=#ad5cff>Kaiju</color> occupying your
        area. Your units are incapable of hurting that <color=red>Beast</color>,
        but you can <color=#ffe45c>stagger</color> the Kaiju when dealt with enough
        damage. '
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Do not forget to gather <color=#5cffe4>Corrupted Plants and Crystals</color>
        for samples along the way, Commander. It could become useful for our next
        expedition.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Kindly proceed with caution, <color=#ffe45c>Commander</color>. Nexus,
        Out.
  Forest2:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Your second mission is to <color=#5cffe4>Shutdown The Former's Oil Pump
        and Pipelines</color> stationed in Point Beta.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: <color=red>The Former</color> have established their oil pumps which
        is currently producing an enormous amount of <color=#ad5cff>toxic waste</color>
        that is corrupting its surroundings. You must <color=#5cffe4>shut it down</color>,
        before the <color=#ad5cff>toxic waste</color> spread across this area.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Intel suggests that the <color=red>The Oil Pumps</color> have attracted
        the <color=#ad5cff>Chelonia</color> you fought from your previous expedition.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Do not engage the <color=#ad5cff>Chelonia</color>, unless it is necessary.
        Proceed with caution, <color=#ffe45c>Commander</color>. Nexus, Out.
  Forest3:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Your third mission is to <color=#5cffe4>Restore Point Charlie</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Due to <color=red>The Former's</color> presence in the surrounding area,
        <color=#ad5cff>toxic wastes</color> have been scattered around Point Charlie.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Intel suggests that the <color=#ad5cff>Chelonia</color> is present within
        the area.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Do not engage the <color=#ad5cff>Chelonia</color>, unless it is necessary.
        Proceed with caution, <color=#ffe45c>Commander</color>. Nexus, Out.
  Forest4:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Your final mission in this planet is to <color=#5cffe4>Extract The Chelonia's
        Samples</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: HQ have decided that the <color=#ad5cff>Chelonia</color> must not be
        slain <color=#ffe45c>AT ALL COSTS</color>. Its samples will be used for researching
        an antidote for the <color=#ad5cff>corruption</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Intel suggests that our scouts have found the <color=#ad5cff>Chelonia's</color>
        habitat. You must stagger that <color=red>Beast</color>, then extract its
        <color=#ffe45c>samples</color> safely.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: As always, proceed with caution, <color=#ffe45c>Commander</color>. Nexus,
        Out.
  Armory:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: This is the <color=#5cffe4>Armory</color> where you'll be spending your
        time tinkering and researching upgrades for your <color=#ffe45c>Mecha Units</color>.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: The <color=#5cffe4>Upgrades Tab</color> is where you'll be able to upgrade
        your units in <color=#ffe45c>Tiers</color> by spending your <color=#5cffe4>Research
        Points Tab</color> from the top right of your screen.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: That will be all for now, <color=#ffe45c>Commander</color>.
  Deployment:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: This is the <color=#5cffe4>Deployment Screen</color> where you'll be
        spending your time selecting your <color=#ffe45c>Mecha Units</color> you
        want to deploy for this mission.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Remember. You only have a <color=#ffe45c>MAXMIMUM</color> of 4 <color=#ffe45c>Mecha
        Units</color> for each mission. Also, HQ has recommended to bring at least
        1 <color=#ffe45c>Worker Unit</color>. Don't worry, we already have supplied
        that for you.
    - character:
        name: NEXUS
      line: Good luck out there, <color=#ffe45c>Commander</color>. For GAIA!
  canvas: {fileID: 0}
  box: {fileID: 0}
